---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPortrait from '../assets/about/mw-portrait.png';
---

<section id="about" class="about section-block" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about__grid">
			<div class="about__content">
				<div class="heading-block">
					<p class="text-accent section-label">Beyond the browser</p>
					<h2 id="about-heading">Everyone deserves quality, and I want to bring it to them.</h2>
					<div class="about__body content-copy">
						<p>
							I love the little things. Tweaking a margin, getting a color just right,
							finding imagery that actually belongs. That is the work I want to do.
						</p>
						<p>
							A million-dollar brand and a mom-and-pop shop get the same attention. I come
							from a small town where marketing is not always a priority, and that sticks
							with me. I think about the little guys, and the businesses that could really
							benefit from some love and care.
						</p>
						<p>
							Outside of work, I love the outdoors. Small town, remember? Camping, fishing,
							target practice, or keeping up with NBA basketball. It is how I unplug, get
							my hands on something, and come back with a new perspective.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about__media">
				<Image
					class="about__portrait"
					src={aboutPortrait}
					alt="Matthew smiling in a cap sitting in a folding chair holding a drink beside a glowing campfire in a green park, creating a relaxed mood."
					widths={[320, 448, 640]}
					sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22rem, min(100vw - 2.5rem, 22rem)"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-lg);
	}

	@media (min-width: 64rem) {
		.about__grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) var(--home-rail);
			gap: var(--space-xl);
			align-items: start;
		}
	}

	.about__media {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.about__portrait {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: var(--home-rail);
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background-color: var(--color-surface-muted);
	}
</style>
